sequenceDiagram
    participant Student as Signed-in client
    participant RPC as Restricted baseline RPC
    participant DB as Owner record and receipts
    Student->>RPC: Operation ID, definition, expected revision, answers
    RPC->>RPC: Derive owner from authentication
    RPC->>DB: Begin atomic owner write and lock
    alt Same operation and request hash already committed
        DB-->>RPC: Stored acknowledgement
        RPC-->>Student: Replay acknowledgement
    else New valid operation
        RPC->>DB: Check revision and original immutability
        RPC->>DB: Save draft or fix submitted original and receipt
        DB-->>RPC: Commit together
        RPC-->>Student: Acknowledgement
    else Changed retry, stale revision or immutable original
        DB-->>RPC: Reject and roll back transaction
        RPC-->>Student: Controlled conflict, preserve saved data
    end
    Note over Student,DB: Uncertain network outcome: retry same operation or reload owner state
